			title: "Fusion"
			x: 22.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["543F014BB97A45F4"]
			description: ["Mars's neodymium and plain hydrogen go in, &6Europium&r comes out, and nothing else in the pack makes it. It leaves the ring as a very hot liquid, not a plasma, so pipe it accordingly. The ZPM motor wants a lot of it as fine wire."]
			icon: "gtceu:europium_ingot"
			id: "1531C1737C6BE31B"
			rewards: [{ id: "78D7DB85185F24E8", type: "xp", xp: 100 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "3FA5997B75AD7194", item: "gtceu:europium_ingot", type: "item" }]
			title: "Europium"
			x: 24.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1531C1737C6BE31B"]
			description: [
				"The &6Research Station&r and the HPCA turn computation into data orbs, and the first one worth writing is the ZPM energy hatch's. Their wiring needs the large mixer on two LuV hatches, and the europium went into the station's ZPM motors."
				"Computer casings, a data bank and plenty of optical pipe come first."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:research_station"
			id: "32CEA916CCFD8B21"
			rewards: [
				{ id: "1542FA63425C2185", type: "xp", xp: 150 }
