		}
		{
			dependencies: ["32CEA916CCFD8B21"]
			description: ["Trinium and naquadah alloy make the &6ZPM Machine Hull&r, and the ZPM energy hatch needs everything you learned out here. Bring the wetware, the catalogue and the Saturn chart along: the next trip starts in orbit and never touches the ground."]
			icon: "gtceu:zpm_machine_hull"
